  "notes": "USAGE:\nAn intransitive verb. The target that attracts the crowd is marked with に. Conveys a sense of many individuals converging eagerly or instinctively on one point.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {虫|むし}が{群|むら}がる (insects swarm)\n- {人|ひと}が{群|むら}がる (people crowd around)\n- {群|むら}がって{来|く}る (to come swarming)\n\nGRAMMAR:\nGodan verb (ら{行|ぎょう}). Te-form: {群|むら}がって. Past: {群|むら}がった. Negative: {群|むら}がらない.",
